[{"client_msg_id":"ff5009b5-c3db-45d9-ac43-d1d21355752f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Web 版のはまずサービスを作る必要がある。プラグインの help も表示できるので…","ts":"1627784605.036700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h1FiC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e601b04a-1ce0-4b66-abed-bdcff4067799","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ページネーション派、スレッド派、スニペット派","ts":"1627784583.036200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wC6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35123d87-777b-46b6-904a-ca196e16e68f","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Or `@pageAll` で連投とか","ts":"1627784437.035700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dq+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0ba442c-c094-4f9d-bde7-cf5491d73203","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"適当にページネーションして\n\n```:h hoge@page3```\nみたいにするとか。これなら「何となくこの辺」みたいなときに使いやすいかも？\nで `@pageX` が指定されてない場合は上記の機能を再帰で呼び出して連投とか？","ts":"1627784420.035400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4XIhk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"511ad586-6e04-43ab-965c-f56968437f30","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"先頭数行を表示＋入り切らない分はweb版のurlを添付するとか…？","ts":"1627783966.033400","edited":{"user":"U017BU3UZBQ","ts":"1627784141.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E3PwF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e56e3dd-3b42-4f27-a941-a7a2f4f63d95","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"この bot は一応 gitter とかでも動いているので、Slack 専用の処理を入れるのも若干のダルさはある (しかし利用率を考えると致し方なし感も感じている)","ts":"1627783788.032100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jyX1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07a38dac-38b6-443e-9b48-b212f01cf1f3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最初のn行(任意設定とかm%くらいを1つめにしてスレッドくらいが良さそうに思ったりはしますが...面倒そうでもありますね","ts":"1627783671.031100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5aZ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U029L2K3YCW","text":"\u003c@U029L2K3YCW\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1627783658.030700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fa6cc953-9409-415c-a52a-a15352e627a1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"長すぎるとバグるのも実際の問題なんですが、どちらかと言うと画面が埋まっちゃうのがあんまりよくないなぁと思っていました","ts":"1627783587.030100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dGyr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcfa66ac-3997-4f81-ade3-c68be92f9d83","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"「長すぎてバグる」という問題だったんですか？\nてっきり「画面上で長すぎて邪魔」という話だと思っていましたが。","ts":"1627780178.029500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0mz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1a8d2d2-6859-463c-a55a-1e2e3ca59db0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それもありか","ts":"1627779628.028700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2CNWe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1de53d45-8b6e-4cd8-936e-cf79202933e4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと、いまさらなんですが、スニペット化じゃなくても、前のメッセージへのリプライによるスレッド化という手もなくはないですね(直前だけならステートとまでいかなくてすむ?)","ts":"1627779512.028500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u4ml+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40af0521-8ad5-4401-83a2-90b37962d6a6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"「ヘルプの分割がうまくいかず意図せず長いテキストになっている」「実際に見たいのは冒頭箇所だけだった」みたいなこともありますし、\n極端に長い結果になる場合は一旦自動で4000文字以内に切り詰められるようにして、 スニペットで出してほしいときは\n```:h hoge @snippet```\nみたいなフラグを付ける、といった運用にしても良いかもしれません。\n（スニペットが面倒そうなら一旦自動切り詰めの運用だけでも良いかも？）","ts":"1627776208.027400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PUUUw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a987b0d2-c921-459e-88b4-b0902bd09f1f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"3年前の記事ですが、どうやら4000文字あたりに「1つの投稿で投稿しきれるかどうか」の境界がある模様。\n\u003chttps://www.cotegg.com/blog/?p=1951\u003e\nなので、4000文字を超えなければそのまま、超えるならスニペット、としてみるとよいのではないでしょうか。","ts":"1627775822.023800","attachments":[{"fallback":"COTeggのバケツ: slackの文字数の限界を調べてみる | COTeggのバケツ","id":1,"title":"slackの文字数の限界を調べてみる | COTeggのバケツ","title_link":"https://www.cotegg.com/blog/?p=1951","text":"なんとなく使ってるslack。 なんとなくでなくなるのはどこからか、気になったの ...","image_url":"https://www.cotegg.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/2018-10-30-01_01_36-Slack-dododo.png","blocks":null,"ts":1541086709,"service_name":"COTeggのバケツ","from_url":"https://www.cotegg.com/blog/?p=1951","original_url":"https://www.cotegg.com/blog/?p=1951"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W=K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14860a30-7d72-42bc-afc0-40d6bd72832f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"添付するの普通に Slack API を叩く必要があるっぽくて地味にめんどそうだった…","ts":"1627751657.022500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t8bC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77550bf5-ac46-49ac-87ce-68c174019e0e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"てか hubot-slack にオプションないんだろうか。探してみるか","ts":"1627751268.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iYMun"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a977641e-4014-40a3-ab7f-4b3db9a9e126","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"やるとしたら、N 行以上のでかい結果はスニペット、使い回しはなし、毎回添付し直す、かなぁ。N をいくつにするのが妥当かは要相談","ts":"1627751223.021700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h57"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bc831e4-2594-4ba5-932e-1b421d321855","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(誰が実装するんだ)","ts":"1627751190.021400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OIKtv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b54e3823-b0d7-4c76-9279-921aff883a39","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"slacklog 上では現状はできないです。ただまあ実装すればいいと言う話はある","ts":"1627751164.021100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UP6PA1UBE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CHY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2774674c-6778-458c-8a64-98af30519991","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"そういえばスニペット内テキストはslacklogでは検索できないです？","ts":"1627751141.020600","edited":{"user":"UP6PA1UBE","ts":"1627751161.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"frgzF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aee58b9b-d7bb-497d-b277-1348e485a0a9","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"添付ファイルどうする問題はまだ未解決ですよねぇ","ts":"1627751095.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d2YQu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fdce537-0dd8-43f4-865b-21fb416db7aa","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ただまあ今は 1 つのリポジトリに突っ込んでるのでメッセージに入ろうが添付ファイルに入ろうが大差ないというのはそのとおり","ts":"1627751087.019100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ENjH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"863f85c4-dada-4a06-b2ba-09adf764059c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"スニペットは添付ファイルの扱いになります。画像とかと同じ","ts":"1627751059.018300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LChc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7adc5b0e-bde7-4b17-81b9-ba6429f3faa4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ただまあやっぱりサイズ的に誤差なので容量についてはあまり考えなくてもよさそう","ts":"1627751047.018000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d4jiX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bd82a9f-000d-47fc-921f-2579170ee865","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"slacklogのほうはスニペットどうなるんでしょう","ts":"1627751036.017800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vw4KW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84b1fd95-2e9e-43a4-808c-7b4eb9810f78","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうですね","ts":"1627751005.017200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TU/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f92761d9-0a84-47b4-ab69-55dba80df89f","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Slack上ではどっちにしろ過去ログも過去ファイルも見れないのでは","ts":"1627750966.017000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CgMf3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfe073e7-0e64-4995-8a85-27690fabd70a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"添付ファイルは最新 5GB 分辺りまでしか見れない","ts":"1627750952.016700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"00BI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"896248b9-c5c6-469a-931d-4a6335a1758b","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ん、過去のが見えなくなるのにどういうインパクトがあるんでしたっけ？","ts":"1627750913.015900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JQtpa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c0cbe84-4e07-40b2-a988-ebfcdb0ed2b4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ただまあ画像に比べれば微々たるものではある","ts":"1627750857.014800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uJDD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8a2e03c-9234-47c9-83e5-f2276f93c83f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"容量、地味だけど変わります。添付ファイルは別カウントなので","ts":"1627750838.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IQ0z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b15f683-a110-447e-9272-7631a13454bf","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ログが長くなるのと比べても容量としてはどっちでも変わんないですけど、同じ感覚を持ちますw(いいのか？)という","ts":"1627750812.013900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h/L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e68e478-de5b-4a47-8783-eb6abd3eb262","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"使い回しは、過去に投稿したスニペットを覚えている必要もあるんですよね。状態は持ちたくない…","ts":"1627750812.013800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oq9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"569563ad-cd81-4df6-be1b-3094b190053b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"help 引く度に添付ファイルが増えるのも果たしてどうなのか、みたいな思いはある (ダメとも言えないけど、いいんだろうか? くらいの感覚)","ts":"1627750752.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GX0C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50784b88-3042-4575-8416-ed1000744263","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Slackとしては使いまわし自体はできますけど、thincaさんの言う通り更新をチェックしないといけないので複雑に","ts":"1627750746.012500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ys5D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d665780c-93ba-4e50-a148-0684c7c35e04","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"使い回しは help が更新されているかどうかのチェックがキビしい","ts":"1627750687.010700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cKVjX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef743baa-9ffe-4810-87b8-2384981daaab","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そもそも個人的には一々スニペットが生成されるのはあまり嬉しくはないですが","ts":"1627750676.010400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u4s7I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9178b6f8-677f-4492-9884-47d139b85d6b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"スニペット自体はがんばればできます。hubot なのでちょっと面倒","ts":"1627750651.009700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_